      <activity id="b867d129-be0b-5bf7-8852-21e8388b18d6" activityNameId="448da3a5-1793-59ab-b8da-6c721439556c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Paper mill, integrated</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Paper mill, integrated
The dataset represents an integrated paper mill with a annual production of 368 kt and a total life time of 50 years.;
UUID: e38026bf-b5ce-3853-a7df-281da2743f60
This module includes land-use, buildings (hall and multi-story) and streets within the mill area, machineries for pulp, paper and energy production as well as the dismanteling/disposal of the whole infrastructure (without the paper machine)
Location: Average land-use from European paper mills, valable for whole Europe
Technology: Typical European paper mill
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: Only land-use data are average data from European paper mills. Other information is estimated, based on photos and literature
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e38026bf-b5ce-3853-a7df-281da2743f60.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
